---
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
import GuideHeader from "../../components/help/GuideHeader.astro";
import GuideNav from "../../components/help/GuideNav.astro";
import Steps from "../../components/help/Steps.astro";
import Callout from "../../components/help/Callout.astro";
import RelatedGuides from "../../components/help/RelatedGuides.astro";

const sections = [
  { id: "find", label: "Find something" },
  { id: "check", label: "Check the listing" },
  { id: "how", label: "How buying works" },
  { id: "negotiate", label: "Negotiating a price" },
  { id: "cart", label: "Using the cart" },
  { id: "chat", label: "Chatting with sellers" },
];
---

<Page
  title="Buying on NyasaBuy"
  description="How to find an item, ask the seller, pay safely in the app and receive your order on NyasaBuy."
>
  <GuideHeader
    title="Buying on NyasaBuy"
    intro="From finding something you like to holding it in your hands. Here is how it works, step by step."
  />
  <GuideNav items={sections} />

  <article class="guide">
    <section id="find">
      <h2>Find something</h2>
      <p>
        Use the search bar, or browse by category on the home page. Too many
        results? Tap <strong>Filters</strong> to narrow them down by:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Price range</li>
        <li>Condition: brand new or fairly used</li>
        <li>Location</li>
        <li>Whether the seller can deliver</li>
        <li>Whether the price is negotiable</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        You can also sort by newest or by price. Tap the <strong>heart</strong>{" "}
        on any listing to save it to your wishlist, and share a listing with a
        friend using its link.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="check">
      <h2>Check the listing and the seller</h2>
      <p>
        Each listing shows up to four photos, the description, the condition,
        the price and where the item is. Tap the seller's name to see their
        other listings and what other buyers have said about them.
      </p>
      <p>
        A green dot and <strong>Online</strong> means the seller is using the
        app right now. Otherwise you will see when they were last around.
        Sellers can switch this off if they prefer.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="how">
      <h2>How buying works</h2>
      <p>
        Buying on NyasaBuy starts with a quick chat, so you know the item is
        still there before you pay.
      </p>
      <Steps
        items={[
          {
            title: "Tap Buy now",
            body: "Your chat with the seller opens with a message already written: “Hi, I'm interested in this product… Is it still available?” Change it if you like, then send it.",
          },
          {
            title: "The seller confirms",
            body: "They tell you the item is available. If they deliver, they also say how many days delivery will take. You get a notification when they reply.",
          },
          {
            title: "Tap Pay now",
            body: "You will see the price, the quantity and, for a delivery, the delivery time the seller agreed to. If both are offered, choose pickup or delivery.",
          },
          {
            title: "Pay in the app",
            body: "Pay with Airtel Money, TNM Mpamba or your card on the secure payment page. A receipt appears in your chat as soon as it goes through.",
          },
          {
            title: "Receive it and tap Received",
            body: "When your order arrives, confirm it. The seller is then paid, and you can rate them.",
          },
        ]}
      />
      <Callout title="Why chat first?">
        <p>
          So you never pay for something that has already been sold, and so the
          delivery time is agreed <em>before</em> you pay, not after.
        </p>
      </Callout>
      <Callout title="Good to know" tone="good">
        <ul>
          <li>A seller's confirmation stays open for 48 hours. After that, just ask again.</li>
          <li>Once you start paying, the item is held for you for about 30 minutes.</li>
          <li>Buying more than one? The seller confirms the quantity with you in the chat.</li>
        </ul>
      </Callout>
    </section>

    <section id="negotiate">
      <h2>Negotiating a price</h2>
      <p>
        Some sellers mark their price as <strong>negotiable</strong>. In the
        chat, tap <strong>Make an offer</strong> and enter an amount below the
        asking price.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>The seller can accept or decline. They are asked to confirm before accepting.</li>
        <li>If they accept, you have 48 hours to pay that price.</li>
        <li>You can have one offer open at a time, and you can withdraw it.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="cart">
      <h2>Using the cart</h2>
      <p>
        The cart is a place to <strong>hold items</strong> while you shop,
        including items from different sellers. You can keep up to 20 listings
        in it.
      </p>
      <Steps
        items={[
          {
            title: "Add items",
            body: "Tap Add to cart on any listing. In the cart you can change the quantity and choose pickup or delivery for each item.",
          },
          {
            title: "Tap Check out",
            body: "Each seller receives your “Is it still available?” message in their own chat.",
          },
          {
            title: "Watch them confirm",
            body: "Each item shows “Waiting for the seller”, then “Seller confirmed” as they reply.",
          },
          {
            title: "Pay",
            body: "Pay for a confirmed item straight away with Pay now, or wait until every seller has confirmed and pay for everything in one go.",
          },
        ]}
      />
      <Callout title="Good to know" tone="good">
        <p>
          Items in your cart are not reserved for you. An item is held only once
          its seller confirms and you start paying.
        </p>
      </Callout>
    </section>

    <section id="chat">
      <h2>Chatting with sellers</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Ask anything before you buy: sizes, condition, where to collect.</li>
        <li>Made a typo? You can edit a message within 15 minutes of sending it. It then shows as <em>edited</em>.</li>
        <li>Messages cannot be deleted, so our team can look at them if something goes wrong.</li>
        <li>Something does not feel right? Use the <strong>⋯</strong> menu in the chat to report the other person.</li>
      </ul>
      <Callout title="Keep payments in the app" tone="safety">
        <p>
          Never agree to pay by Airtel Money, TNM Mpamba, bank transfer or cash
          sent in advance. Only payments made in the app are protected.{" "}
          <a href="/help/payments-and-safety">Read how to stay safe</a>.
        </p>
      </Callout>
    </section>

    <RelatedGuides current="buying" />
  </article>
</Page>
